Subject: [PATCH 11/22] media: add the Realtek RTD129x HDMI receiver

The driver itself is kept outside the kernel tree, in kernel/src/hdmirx,
and copied in by scripts/build-kernel.sh; it carries its own
Kconfig and Makefile. These two lines hook that directory in.

Source: https://github.com/JalenLin/BPI-W2-linux

Signed-off-by: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
